00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:39.840
If we look at more polls, you'll see that.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.780
Trump is leading some of them, but more recently,
Biden's leading all of them.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:47.509
If you look at an Emerson poll from about
two weeks ago, it's Biden plus one.

00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:52.840
If you look at a Wall Street Journal poll
from about two and a half weeks ago, it's

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.410
Biden plus six.

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:59.130
And then before that, you had Trump leading
three polls in a row, one of which was an

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.880
